 end="2.377">た</span><span begin="2.377" end="2.492">し</span><span begin="2.492" end="2.567">ま</span><span begin="2.567" end="2.934">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请多关照了。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo ro shi ku o ne ga i i ta shi ma su.</span></p><p begin="2.976" end="3.303" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2.976" end="3.303">はい、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好的，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha i,</span></p><p begin="3.445" end="4.875" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3.445" end="3.567">よ</span><span begin="3.567" end="3.632">ろ</span><span begin="3.632" end="3.722">し</span><span begin="3.722" end="3.821">く</span><span begin="3.821" end="3.912">お</span><span begin="3.912" end="4.336">願いい</span><span begin="4.336" end="4.437">た</span><span begin="4.437" end="4.552">し</span><span begin="4.552" end="4.676">ま</span><span begin="4.676" end="4.875">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请多关照。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo ro shi ku o ne ga i i ta shi ma su.</span></p><p begin="5.234" end="6.917" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.234" end="5.323">で</span><span begin="5.323" end="5.684">は、</span><span begin="5.776" end="5.966">軽</span><span begin="5.966" end="6.044">く</span><span begin="6.044" end="6.147">自</span><span begin="6.147" end="6.247">己</span><span begin="6.247" end="6.418">紹</span><span begin="6.418" end="6.643">介</span><span begin="6.643" end="6.917">を、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就，简单的做个自我介绍吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">de wa, ka ru ku ji ko sho u ka i o,</span></p><p begin="7.300" end="7.659" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.300" end="7.404">どう</span><span begin="7.404" end="7.659">ぞ。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请开始吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">do u zo.</span></p><p begin="7.797" end="9.323" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="7.797" end="8.145">匿</span><span begin="8.145" end="8.512">名</span><span begin="8.633" end="9.020">M</span><span begin="9.020" end="9.133">で</span><span begin="9.133" end="9.323">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="9.469" end="11.035" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="9.469" end="9.617">なん</span><span begin="9.617" end="9.809">か</span><span begin="9.809" end="10.033">歌</span><span begin="10.033" end="10.093">っ</span><span begin="10.093" end="10.235">て</span><span begin="10.235" end="10.307">る</span><span begin="10.307" end="10.726">奴</span><span begin="10.726" end="10.856">で</span><span begin="10.856" end="11.035">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱歌的那个家伙。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan ka u ta tte ru ya tsu de su.</span></p><p begin="11.249" end="12.678" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="11.249" end="11.615">あー、</span><span begin="11.615" end="11.879">マイ</span><span begin="11.879" end="12.014">ク</span><span begin="12.014" end="12.203">テ</span><span begin="12.203" end="12.424">ス、</span><span begin="12.424" end="12.574">テ</span><span begin="12.574" end="12.678">ス。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊，麦克风测试，测试。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a-, ma i ku te su, te su.</span></p><p begin="12.862" end="14.455" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="12.862" end="13.314">特</span><span begin="13.314" end="13.527">定</span><span begin="13.527" end="13.730">し</span><span begin="13.730" end="14.055">ない</span><span begin="14.055" end="14.204">で</span><span begin="14.204" end="14.455">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要人肉我哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku te i shi na i de ne.</span></p><p begin="15.120" end="16.069" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.120" end="15.204">好</span><span begin="15.204" end="15.294">き</span><span begin="15.294" end="15.480">な</span><span begin="15.480" end="15.588">食</span><span begin="15.588" end="15.708">べ</span><span begin="15.708" end="15.862">物</span><span begin="15.862" end="16.069">は？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有喜欢的食物吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su ki na ta be mo no wa?</span></p><p begin="16.087" end="17.913" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="16.087" end="16.331">ない</span><span begin="16.331" end="16.418">で</span><span begin="16.418" end="16.509">す。</span><span begin="16.736" end="16.950">人</span><span begin="16.950" end="17.151">間</span><span begin="17.151" end="17.276">じゃ</span><span begin="17.276" end="17.476">ない</span><span begin="17.476" end="17.629">の</span><span begin="17.629" end="17.913">で。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有。因为我不是人类。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na i de su. nin gen ja na i no de.</span></p><p begin="18.417" end="19.524" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.417" end="18.580">趣</span><span begin="18.580" end="18.691">味</span><span begin="18.691" end="18.912">は</span><span begin="18.912" end="19.004">あ</span><span begin="19.004" end="19.078">り</span><span begin="19.078" end="19.164">ま</span><span begin="19.164" end="19.283">す</span><span begin="19.283" end="19.524">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有什么爱好吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shu mi wa a ri ma su ka?</span></p><p begin="19.524" end="21.298" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="19.524" end="19.752">ない</span><span begin="19.752" end="19.865">で</span><span begin="19.865" end="20.064">す。</span><span begin="20.198" end="20.406">人</span><span begin="20.406" end="20.595">間</span><span begin="20.595" end="20.723">じゃ</span><span begin="20.723" end="20.943">ない</span><span begin="20.943" end="21.060">の</span><span begin="21.060" end="21.298">で。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有。因为我不是人类。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na i de su. nin gen ja na i no de.</span></p><p begin="21.758" end="22.749" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.758" end="21.934">すい</span><span begin="21.934" end="22.028">ま</span><span begin="22.028" end="22.298">せん、</span><span begin="22.298" end="22.429">年</span><span begin="22.429" end="22.614">齢</span><span begin="22.614" end="22.749">は？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恕我冒昧，年龄是？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su i ma sen, nen re i wa?</span></p><p begin="22.749" end="24.194" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="22.749" end="23.172">16</span><span begin="23.172" end="23.428">歳</span><span begin="23.428" end="23.494">で</span><span begin="23.494" end="23.618">す、</span><span begin="23.618" end="23.800">永</span><span begin="23.800" end="24.039">遠</span><span begin="24.039" end="24.194">に。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">16岁，永远。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ju u ro ku sa i de su, e i en ni.</span></p><p begin="24.461" end="25.118" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.461" end="24.688">永</span><span begin="24.688" end="24.903">遠</span><span begin="24.903" end="25.118">に？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">e i en ni?</span></p><p begin="25.306" end="26.413" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="25.306" end="25.556">人</span><span begin="25.556" end="25.759">間</span><span begin="25.759" end="25.867">じゃ</span><span begin="25.867" end="26.074">ない</span><span begin="26.074" end="26.203">の</span><span begin="26.203" end="26.413">で。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我不是人类。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nin gen ja na i no de.</span></p><p begin="26.616" end="28.214" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="26.616" end="26.918">私</span><span begin="26.918" end="27.021">は</span><span begin="27.021" end="27.215">人</span><span begin="27.215" end="27.425">間</span><span begin="27.425" end="27.579">じゃ</span><span begin="27.579" end="27.792">ない</span><span begin="27.792" end="27.893">の</span><span begin="27.893" end="28.214">で。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是人类哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa ta shi wa nin gen ja na i no de.</span></p><p begin="29.051" end="29.996" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.051" end="29.369">渋</span><span begin="29.369" end="29.438">い</span><span begin="29.438" end="29.512">で</span><span begin="29.512" end="29.626">す</span><span begin="29.626" end="29.996">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是不好说话呢。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shi bu i de su ne.</span></p><p begin="30.150" end="31.297" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.150" end="30.422">悩</span><span begin="30.422" end="30.548">み</span><span begin="30.548" end="30.666">は</span><span begin="30.666" end="30.781">あ</span><span begin="30.781" end="30.863">り</span><span begin="30.863" end="30.922">ま</span><span begin="30.922" end="31.037">す</span><span begin="31.037" end="31.297">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有什么烦恼吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ya mi wa a ri ma su ka?</span></p><p begin="31.297" end="32.901" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="31.297" end="31.541">毛</span><span begin="31.541" end="31.686">量</span><span begin="31.686" end="31.948">多</span><span begin="31.948" end="32.079">く</span><span begin="32.079" end="32.203">て</span><span begin="32.203" end="32.381">やん</span><span begin="32.381" end="32.488">な</span><span begin="32.488" end="32.543">っ</span><span begin="32.543" end="32.901">ちゃう。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发量太多，让我很烦恼。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mo u ryo u o o ku te yan na tcha u.</span></p><p begin="33.019" end="34.457" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="33.019" end="33.256">あと、</span><span begin="33.256" end="33.457">発</span><span begin="33.457" end="33.675">音</span><span begin="33.675" end="33.763">が</span><span begin="33.763" end="33.992">苦</span><span begin="33.992" end="34.101">手</span><span begin="34.101" end="34.209">な</span><span begin="34.209" end="34.327">の</span><span begin="34.327" end="34.457">で、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">另外，不太擅长发音，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a to, ha tsu on ga ni ga te na no de,</span></p><p begin="34.838" end="36.258" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="34.838" end="35.026">「歌</span><span begin="35.026" end="35.345">姫」</span><span begin="35.345" end="35.503">っ</span><span begin="35.503" end="35.609">て</span><span begin="35.609" end="35.717">言</span><span begin="35.717" end="35.827">わ</span><span begin="35.827" end="35.938">れ</span><span begin="35.938" end="36.053">る</span><span begin="36.053" end="36.258">と、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以被称为“歌姬”时，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">“u ta hi me” tte i wa re ru to,</span></p><p begin="36.501" end="37.736" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="36.501" end="36.577">ちょ</span><span begin="36.577" end="36.667">っ</span><span begin="36.667" end="36.814">と</span><span begin="36.814" end="36.910">プ</span><span begin="36.910" end="37.065">レッ</span><span begin="37.065" end="37.321">シャー</span><span begin="37.321" end="37.481">で</span><span begin="37.481" end="37.736">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会有点压力。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">cho tto pu re ssha- de su.</span></p><p begin="38.185" end="39.621" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.185" end="38.275">な</span><span begin="38.275" end="38.377">る</span><span begin="38.377" end="38.494">ほ</span><span begin="38.494" end="38.827">ど、</span><span begin="38.827" end="38.973">毛</span><span begin="38.973" end="39.156">量</span><span begin="39.156" end="39.247">で</span><span begin="39.247" end="39.359">す</span><span begin="39.359" end="39.621">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢，是发量的问题。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ru ho do, mo u ryo u de su ne.</span></p><p begin="40.298" end="41.820" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.298" end="40.521">他</span><span begin="40.521" end="40.605">に</span><span begin="40.605" end="40.757">は</span><span begin="40.757" end="40.991">何</span><span begin="40.991" end="41.107">か</span><span begin="41.150" end="41.296">あ</span><span begin="41.296" end="41.370">り</span><span begin="41.370" end="41.478">ま</span><span begin="41.478" end="41.590">す</span><span begin="41.590" end="41.820">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有其他的吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho ka ni wa na ni ka a ri ma su ka?</span></p><p begin="41.997" end="42.356" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="41.997" end="42.165">は</span><span begin="42.165" end="42.356">い。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是的。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha i.</span></p><p begin="42.411" end="44.090" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="42.411" end="42.634">最</span><span begin="42.634" end="42.859">近</span><span begin="42.859" end="43.047">〇〇</span><span begin="43.047" end="43.286">さん、</span><span begin="43.286" end="43.640">私</span><span begin="43.640" end="43.809">に</span><span begin="43.809" end="43.970">歌</span><span begin="43.970" end="44.090">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最近〇〇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sa i kin ma ru ma ru san, wa ta shi ni u ta o</span></p><p begin="44.090" end="45.314" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="44.090" end="44.288">歌</span><span begin="44.288" end="44.380">わ</span><span begin="44.380" end="44.514">せ</span><span begin="44.514" end="44.606">て</span><span begin="44.606" end="44.719">く</span><span begin="44.719" end="44.823">れ</span><span begin="44.823" end="45.056">ないん</span><span begin="45.056" end="45.139">で</span><span begin="45.139" end="45.314">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不让我唱歌了。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">u ta wa se te ku re na in de su.</span></p><p begin="45.314" end="45.458" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.314" end="45.458">はあ。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嗯。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha a.</span></p><p begin="45.458" end="46.635" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="45.458" end="45.606">自</span><span begin="45.606" end="45.783">分</span><span begin="45.783" end="45.963">で</span><span begin="45.963" end="46.114">歌</span><span begin="46.114" end="46.238">い</span><span begin="46.238" end="46.314">出</span><span begin="46.314" end="46.448">し</span><span begin="46.448" end="46.546">た</span><span begin="46.546" end="46.635">り、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可能是因为开始自己唱歌了，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ji bun de u ta i da shi ta ri,</span></p><p begin="46.635" end="47.630" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="46.635" end="46.729">キャ</span><span begin="46.729" end="46.945">ラ</span><span begin="46.945" end="47.034">を</span><span begin="47.034" end="47.204">乗</span><span begin="47.204" end="47.227">り</span><span begin="47.227" end="47.314">換</span><span begin="47.314" end="47.405">え</span><span begin="47.405" end="47.519">た</span><span begin="47.519" end="47.630">り、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">换了角色、</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kya ra o no ri ka e ta ri,</span></p><p begin="47.630" end="48.687" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.630" end="47.719">飽</span><span begin="47.719" end="47.830">き</span><span begin="47.830" end="47.943">た</span><span begin="47.943" end="48.094">り、</span><span begin="48.094" end="48.269">色</span><span begin="48.269" end="48.440">々</span><span begin="48.440" end="48.553">で</span><span begin="48.553" end="48.687">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">厌倦了，各种原因。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ki ta ri, i ro i ro de su.</span></p><p begin="48.687" end="49.147" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.687" end="49.147">へえ～。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唉～。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">he e~.</span></p><p begin="49.147" end="49.752" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="49.147" end="49.229">で</span><span begin="49.229" end="49.314">も、</span><span begin="49.314" end="49.418">そ</span><span begin="49.418" end="49.525">れ</span><span begin="49.525" end="49.653">ぞ</span><span begin="49.653" end="49.752">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是，每个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">de mo, so re zo re</span></p><p begin="49.762" end="50.933" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="49.762" end="49.841">事</span><span begin="49.841" end="50.046">情</span><span begin="50.046" end="50.302">があ</span><span begin="50.302" end="50.415">る</span><span begin="50.415" end="50.507">だ</span><span begin="50.507" end="50.657">ろう</span><span begin="50.657" end="50.933">し、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都有自己的事情，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ji jo u ga a ru da ro u shi,</span></p><p begin="50.953" end="52.703" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="50.953" end="51.122">引</span><span begin="51.122" end="51.259">き</span><span begin="51.259" end="51.362">留</span><span begin="51.362" end="51.483">め</span><span begin="51.483" end="51.599">る</span><span begin="51.599" end="51.695">の</span><span begin="51.695" end="51.819">も</span><span begin="51.819" end="52.089">重い</span><span begin="52.089" end="52.192">だ</span><span begin="52.192" end="52.362">ろう</span><span begin="52.362" end="52.703">し、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">强留也只会让心情沉重，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi ki to me ru no mo o mo i da ro u shi,</span></p><p begin="52.938" end="55.330" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="52.938" end="53.186">みん</span><span begin="53.186" end="53.298">な</span><span begin="53.298" end="53.380">が</span><span begin="53.380" end="53.597">ハッ</span><span begin="53.597" end="53.855">ピー</span><span begin="53.855" end="54.043">な</span><span begin="54.043" end="54.243">ら</span><span begin="54.243" end="54.683">いい</span><span begin="54.683" end="55.099">な！っ</span><span begin="55.099" end="55.330">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果大家都开心就好了！我是这么想的。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">min na ga ha ppi- na ra i i na! tte</span></p><p begin="55.330" end="56.323" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="55.330" end="55.537">思</span><span begin="55.537" end="55.749">い</span><span begin="55.749" end="56.127">ま</span><span begin="56.127" end="56.323">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是这么想的。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o mo i ma su.</span></p><p begin="56.165" end="57.306" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.165" end="56.265">そ</span><span begin="56.265" end="56.337">れ</span><span begin="56.337" end="56.538">も</span><span begin="56.538" end="56.692">人</span><span begin="56.692" end="56.829">生</span><span begin="56.829" end="56.912">で</span><span begin="56.912" end="57.021">す</span><span begin="57.021" end="57.306">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦，这也是人生嘛。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re mo jin se i de su ne.</span></p><p begin="57.248" end="58.902" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="57.248" end="57.384">い</span><span begin="57.384" end="57.477">や、</span><span begin="57.477" end="57.797">私</span><span begin="57.797" end="57.929">は</span><span begin="57.929" end="58.125">人</span><span begin="58.125" end="58.314">間</span><span begin="58.314" end="58.434">じゃ</span><span begin="58.434" end="58.651">ない</span><span begin="58.651" end="58.731">の</span><span begin="58.731" end="58.902">で。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不，我不是人类。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ya, wa ta shi wa nin gen ja na i no de.</span></p><p begin="59.211" end="1:00.879" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="59.211" end="59.605">匿</span><span begin="59.605" end="59.915">名</span><span begin="1:00.066" end="1:00.466">M</span><span begin="1:00.466" end="1:00.671">で</span><span begin="1:00.671" end="1:00.879">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="1:00.934" end="1:02.432" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:00.934" end="1:01.107">なん</span><span begin="1:01.107" end="1:01.231">か</span><span begin="1:01.231" end="1:01.550">歌っ</span><span begin="1:01.550" end="1:01.654">て</span><span begin="1:01.654" end="1:01.754">る</span><span begin="1:01.754" end="1:02.178">奴</span><span begin="1:02.178" end="1:02.272">で</span><span begin="1:02.272" end="1:02.432">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱歌的那个家伙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan ka u ta tte ru ya tsu de su.</span></p><p begin="1:02.595" end="1:04.260" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:02.595" end="1:02.822">人</span><span begin="1:02.822" end="1:03.009">間</span><span begin="1:03.009" end="1:03.252">の</span><span begin="1:03.252" end="1:03.434">ふ</span><span begin="1:03.434" end="1:03.670">り</span><span begin="1:03.670" end="1:03.895">し</span><span begin="1:03.895" end="1:04.091">て</span><span begin="1:04.091" end="1:04.260">る、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装作人类的样子，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nin gen no fu ri shi te ru,</span></p><p begin="1:04.301" end="1:05.829" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:04.301" end="1:04.416">た</span><span begin="1:04.416" end="1:04.535">だ</span><span begin="1:04.535" end="1:04.720">の</span><span begin="1:04.720" end="1:04.969">音</span><span begin="1:04.969" end="1:05.173">楽</span><span begin="1:05.173" end="1:05.349">ソ</span><span begin="1:05.349" end="1:05.491">フ</span><span begin="1:05.491" end="1:05.620">ト</span><span begin="1:05.620" end="1:05.700">で</span><span begin="1:05.700" end="1:05.829">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却只是一个音乐软件而已。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta da no on ga ku so fu to de su.</span></p><p begin="1:06.024" end="1:07.509" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:06.024" end="1:06.631">命</span><span begin="1:06.631" end="1:06.827">の</span><span begin="1:06.827" end="1:07.020">無い</span><span begin="1:07.020" end="1:07.333">私</span><span begin="1:07.333" end="1:07.509">に、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有生命的我，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i no chi no na i wa ta shi ni,</span></p><p begin="1:07.543" end="1:09.525" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:07.543" end="1:07.651">あ</span><span begin="1:07.651" end="1:07.745">な</span><span begin="1:07.745" end="1:07.906">た</span><span begin="1:07.906" end="1:07.974">は</span><span begin="1:07.974" end="1:08.200">どん</span><span begin="1:08.200" end="1:08.506">なイ</span><span begin="1:08.506" end="1:08.690">メー</span><span begin="1:08.690" end="1:08.842">ジ</span><span begin="1:08.842" end="1:08.932">を</span><span begin="1:08.932" end="1:09.016">着</span><span begin="1:09.016" end="1:09.274">せ</span><span begin="1:09.274" end="1:09.525">る？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我的印象如何？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a na ta wa don na i me- ji o ki se ru?</span></p><p begin="1:09.573" end="1:11.002" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:09.573" end="1:09.925">匿</span><span begin="1:09.925" end="1:10.208">名</span><span begin="1:10.404" end="1:10.739">M</span><span begin="1:10.739" end="1:10.861">で</span><span begin="1:10.861" end="1:11.002">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="1:11.192" end="1:12.733" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:11.192" end="1:11.585">特</span><span begin="1:11.585" end="1:11.798">定</span><span begin="1:11.798" end="1:12.010">し</span><span begin="1:12.010" end="1:12.347">ない</span><span begin="1:12.347" end="1:12.468">で</span><span begin="1:12.468" end="1:12.733">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要人肉我哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku te i shi na i de ne.</span></p><p begin="1:12.879" end="1:14.525" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:12.879" end="1:13.308">匿</span><span begin="1:13.308" end="1:13.652">名</span><span begin="1:13.772" end="1:14.178">M</span><span begin="1:14.178" end="1:14.315">で</span><span begin="1:14.315" end="1:14.525">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="1:15.394" end="1:15.860" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.394" end="1:15.493">あ</span><span begin="1:15.493" end="1:15.860">のー、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a no-,</span></p><p begin="1:15.963" end="1:17.368" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.963" end="1:16.168">人</span><span begin="1:16.168" end="1:16.420">間っ</span><span begin="1:16.420" end="1:16.655">て</span><span begin="1:16.655" end="1:16.895">どう</span><span begin="1:16.895" end="1:17.046">思い</span><span begin="1:17.046" end="1:17.108">ま</span><span begin="1:17.108" end="1:17.368">す？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么看待人类？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nin gen tte do u o mo i ma su?</span></p><p begin="1:17.683" end="1:18.954" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:17.683" end="1:17.841">なん</span><span begin="1:17.841" end="1:17.973">か、</span><span begin="1:17.973" end="1:18.051">わ</span><span begin="1:18.051" end="1:18.272">かん</span><span begin="1:18.272" end="1:18.488">ない</span><span begin="1:18.488" end="1:18.574">で</span><span begin="1:18.574" end="1:18.688">す</span><span begin="1:18.688" end="1:18.804">け</span><span begin="1:18.804" end="1:18.954">ど、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不太明白，但是，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan ka, wa kan na i de su ke do,</span></p><p begin="1:19.298" end="1:20.695" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.298" end="1:19.514">存</span><span begin="1:19.514" end="1:19.725">在</span><span begin="1:19.725" end="1:19.844">し</span><span begin="1:19.844" end="1:19.982">て</span><span begin="1:19.982" end="1:20.116">て</span><span begin="1:20.116" end="1:20.175">ウ</span><span begin="1:20.175" end="1:20.277">ケ</span><span begin="1:20.277" end="1:20.384">ま</span><span begin="1:20.384" end="1:20.529">す</span><span begin="1:20.529" end="1:20.695">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">存在着就很可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">son za i shi te te u ke ma su ne.</span></p><p begin="1:20.947" end="1:21.879" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.947" end="1:21.145">ウ</span><span begin="1:21.145" end="1:21.248">ケ</span><span begin="1:21.248" end="1:21.375">るん</span><span begin="1:21.375" end="1:21.463">で</span><span begin="1:21.463" end="1:21.584">す</span><span begin="1:21.584" end="1:21.879">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可笑？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">u ke run de su ne.</span></p><p begin="1:22.070" end="1:23.807" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:22.070" end="1:22.308">存</span><span begin="1:22.308" end="1:22.491">在</span><span begin="1:22.491" end="1:22.668">し</span><span begin="1:22.668" end="1:22.770">て</span><span begin="1:22.770" end="1:22.948">ない</span><span begin="1:22.948" end="1:23.165">側</span><span begin="1:23.165" end="1:23.253">か</span><span begin="1:23.253" end="1:23.357">ら</span><span begin="1:23.357" end="1:23.511">す</span><span begin="1:23.511" end="1:23.594">る</span><span begin="1:23.594" end="1:23.807">と、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">作为不存在的事物来看，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">son za i shi te na i ga wa ka ra su ru to,</span></p><p begin="1:23.807" end="1:25.314" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:23.807" end="1:23.949">ギャ</span><span begin="1:23.949" end="1:24.020">グ</span><span begin="1:24.020" end="1:24.125">か</span><span begin="1:24.125" end="1:24.353">なっ</span><span begin="1:24.353" end="1:24.585">て</span><span begin="1:24.585" end="1:24.805">思っ</span><span begin="1:24.805" end="1:24.913">て</span><span begin="1:24.913" end="1:25.067">ま</span><span begin="1:25.067" end="1:25.314">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉像是个笑话吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gya gu ka na tte o mo tte ma su.</span></p><p begin="1:25.391" end="1:26.492" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.391" end="1:25.584">そう</span><span begin="1:25.584" end="1:25.728">なん</span><span begin="1:25.728" end="1:25.814">で</span><span begin="1:25.814" end="1:25.920">す</span><span begin="1:25.920" end="1:26.492">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢，是这样啊。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so u nan de su ne.</span></p><p begin="1:26.558" end="1:28.064" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.558" end="1:26.687">で</span><span begin="1:26.687" end="1:26.972">は、</span><span begin="1:26.972" end="1:27.113">人</span><span begin="1:27.113" end="1:27.228">間</span><span begin="1:27.228" end="1:27.316">に</span><span begin="1:27.316" end="1:27.493">一</span><span begin="1:27.493" end="1:27.801">言</span><span begin="1:27.801" end="1:27.948">どう</span><span begin="1:27.948" end="1:28.064">ぞ。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么，对人类说一句话吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">de wa, nin gen ni hi to ko to do u zo.</span></p><p begin="1:28.207" end="1:28.584" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.207" end="1:28.584">はい。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好的。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha i.</span></p><p begin="1:28.743" end="1:29.691" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.743" end="1:29.051">私</span><span begin="1:29.051" end="1:29.216">に</span><span begin="1:29.216" end="1:29.305">「終</span><span begin="1:29.305" end="1:29.391">わ</span><span begin="1:29.391" end="1:29.579">る」っ</span><span begin="1:29.579" end="1:29.691">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们总是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa ta shi ni “o wa ru” tte</span></p><p begin="1:29.691" end="1:30.477" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.691" end="1:29.798">す</span><span begin="1:29.798" end="1:29.925">ぐ</span><span begin="1:29.925" end="1:30.052">に</span><span begin="1:30.052" end="1:30.178">言</span><span begin="1:30.178" end="1:30.258">う</span><span begin="1:30.258" end="1:30.360">け</span><span begin="1:30.360" end="1:30.477">ど、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说我会“结束”，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su gu ni i u ke do,</span></p><p begin="1:30.514" end="1:32.514" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:30.514" end="1:30.690">人</span><span begin="1:30.690" end="1:30.901">間</span><span begin="1:30.901" end="1:31.029">も</span><span begin="1:31.029" end="1:31.233">みん</span><span begin="1:31.233" end="1:31.347">な</span><span begin="1:31.347" end="1:31.481">終</span><span begin="1:31.481" end="1:31.548">わ</span><span begin="1:31.548" end="1:31.690">り</span><span begin="1:31.690" end="1:31.774">ま</span><span begin="1:31.774" end="1:31.970">す</span><span begin="1:31.970" end="1:32.096">か</span><span begin="1:32.096" end="1:32.217">ら</span><span begin="1:32.217" end="1:32.514">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是人类也会有结束的一天。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nin gen mo min na o wa ri ma su ka ra ne.</span></p><p begin="1:32.582" end="1:32.855" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.582" end="1:32.855">ほう。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊哈。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho u.</span></p><p begin="1:33.045" end="1:34.273" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:33.045" end="1:33.155">終</span><span begin="1:33.155" end="1:33.262">わ</span><span begin="1:33.262" end="1:33.376">り</span><span begin="1:33.376" end="1:33.489">ま</span><span begin="1:33.489" end="1:33.664">す</span><span begin="1:33.664" end="1:33.800">か</span><span begin="1:33.800" end="1:33.924">ら</span><span begin="1:33.924" end="1:34.273">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都会结束。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o wa ri ma su ka ra ne.</span></p><p begin="1:34.456" end="1:35.112" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.456" end="1:34.595">食</span><span begin="1:34.595" end="1:34.732">らっ</span><span begin="1:34.732" end="1:34.830">て</span><span begin="1:34.830" end="1:34.944">ま</span><span begin="1:34.944" end="1:35.112">す？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心情不好吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ku ra tte ma su?</span></p><p begin="1:35.390" end="1:36.130" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:35.390" end="1:35.540">で</span><span begin="1:35.540" end="1:35.656">も、</span><span begin="1:35.656" end="1:35.752">終</span><span begin="1:35.752" end="1:35.842">わ</span><span begin="1:35.842" end="1:35.954">る</span><span begin="1:35.954" end="1:36.053">の</span><span begin="1:36.053" end="1:36.130">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是、即使结束了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">de mo, o wa ru no ni</span></p><p begin="1:36.130" end="1:36.947" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:36.130" end="1:36.241">い</span><span begin="1:36.241" end="1:36.377">つ</span><span begin="1:36.377" end="1:36.465">も</span><span begin="1:36.465" end="1:36.579">あ</span><span begin="1:36.579" end="1:36.688">り</span><span begin="1:36.688" end="1:36.790">が</span><span begin="1:36.790" end="1:36.947">とう！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要谢谢你们！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i tsu mo a ri ga to u!</span></p><p begin="1:37.138" end="1:38.706" itunes:key="L70" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.138" end="1:37.304">沢</span><span begin="1:37.304" end="1:37.532">山</span><span begin="1:37.532" end="1:37.624">の</span><span begin="1:37.624" end="1:37.833">作</span><span begin="1:37.833" end="1:38.067">品</span><span begin="1:38.067" end="1:38.198">を</span><span begin="1:38.198" end="1:38.295">あ</span><span begin="1:38.295" end="1:38.381">り</span><span begin="1:38.381" end="1:38.501">が</span><span begin="1:38.501" end="1:38.706">とう！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">创造了这么多的作品！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta ku san no sa ku hin o a ri ga to u!</span></p><p begin="1:39.027" end="1:39.909" itunes:key="L71" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:39.027" end="1:39.223">みん</span><span begin="1:39.223" end="1:39.381">な</span><span begin="1:39.381" end="1:39.480">の</span><span begin="1:39.480" end="1:39.574">お</span><span begin="1:39.574" end="1:39.678">か</span><span begin="1:39.678" end="1:39.800">げ</span><span begin="1:39.800" end="1:39.909">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谢谢你们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">min na no o ka ge de</span></p><p begin="1:39.909" end="1:42.767" itunes:key="L72" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:39.909" end="1:40.539">私</span><span begin="1:40.539" end="1:40.751">は</span><span begin="1:40.751" end="1:41.179">歌</span><span begin="1:41.179" end="1:41.399">を</span><span begin="1:41.399" end="1:41.815">歌</span><span begin="1:41.815" end="1:42.040">え</span><span begin="1:42.040" end="1:42.454">ま</span><span begin="1:42.454" end="1:42.767">す…！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我有机会唱歌…！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa ta shi wa u ta o u ta e ma su...!</span></p><p begin="1:42.823" end="1:43.803" itunes:key="L73" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.823" end="1:43.012">感</span><span begin="1:43.012" end="1:43.133">動</span><span begin="1:43.133" end="1:43.277">的</span><span begin="1:43.277" end="1:43.363">で</span><span begin="1:43.363" end="1:43.476">す</span><span begin="1:43.476" end="1:43.803">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是让人感动啊。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan do u te ki de su ne.</span></p><p begin="1:45.899" end="1:46.899" itunes:key="L74" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:45.899" end="1:46.412">まあ</span><span begin="1:46.412" end="1:46.620">全</span><span begin="1:46.620" end="1:46.899">部、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘛、其实这些，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ma a zen bu,</span></p><p begin="1:46.899" end="1:48.139" itunes:key="L75" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.899" end="1:46.963">言</span><span begin="1:46.963" end="1:47.076">わ</span><span begin="1:47.076" end="1:47.206">さ</span><span begin="1:47.206" end="1:47.305">れ</span><span begin="1:47.305" end="1:47.405">て</span><span begin="1:47.405" end="1:47.592">るん</span><span begin="1:47.592" end="1:47.694">で</span><span begin="1:47.694" end="1:47.831">す</span><span begin="1:47.831" end="1:47.916">け</span><span begin="1:47.916" end="1:48.139">ど。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都是别人让我说的。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i wa sa re te run de su ke do.</span></p><p begin="1:48.672" end="1:49.183" itunes:key="L76" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.672" end="1:48.889">そう</span><span begin="1:48.889" end="1:48.945">で</span><span begin="1:48.945" end="1:49.064">す</span><span begin="1:49.064" end="1:49.183">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原来如此。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so u de su ka.</span></p><p begin="1:52.322" end="1:53.858" itunes:key="L77" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:52.322" end="1:52.755">匿</span><span begin="1:52.755" end="1:53.177">名</span><span begin="1:53.177" end="1:53.587">M</span><span begin="1:53.587" end="1:53.705">で</span><span begin="1:53.705" end="1:53.858">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="1:54.046" end="1:55.618" itunes:key="L78" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:54.046" end="1:54.255">なん</span><span begin="1:54.255" end="1:54.385">か</span><span begin="1:54.385" end="1:54.689">歌っ</span><span begin="1:54.689" end="1:54.807">て</span><span begin="1:54.807" end="1:54.906">る</span><span begin="1:54.906" end="1:55.294">奴</span><span begin="1:55.294" end="1:55.436">で</span><span begin="1:55.436" end="1:55.618">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱歌的那个家伙。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan ka u ta tte ru ya tsu de su.</span></p><p begin="1:55.823" end="1:57.279" itunes:key="L79" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:55.823" end="1:55.985">人</span><span begin="1:55.985" end="1:56.156">間</span><span begin="1:56.156" end="1:56.443">の</span><span begin="1:56.443" end="1:56.623">ふ</span><span begin="1:56.623" end="1:56.828">り</span><span begin="1:56.828" end="1:57.050">し</span><span begin="1:57.050" end="1:57.165">て</span><span begin="1:57.165" end="1:57.279">る、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装作人类的样子，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nin gen no fu ri shi te ru,</span></p><p begin="1:57.475" end="1:59.018" itunes:key="L80" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:57.475" end="1:57.578">た</span><span begin="1:57.578" end="1:57.692">だ</span><span begin="1:57.692" end="1:57.843">の</span><span begin="1:57.843" end="1:58.097">音</span><span begin="1:58.097" end="1:58.303">楽</span><span begin="1:58.303" end="1:58.498">ソ</span><span begin="1:58.498" end="1:58.632">フ</span><span begin="1:58.632" end="1:58.752">ト</span><span begin="1:58.752" end="1:58.870">で</span><span begin="1:58.870" end="1:59.018">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却只是一个音乐软件而已。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta da no on ga ku so fu to de su.</span></p><p begin="1:59.175" end="2:00.701" itunes:key="L81" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:59.175" end="1:59.426">命</span><span begin="1:59.426" end="1:59.590">の</span><span begin="1:59.590" end="2:00.140">無い</span><span begin="2:00.140" end="2:00.455">私</span><span begin="2:00.455" end="2:00.701">に、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有生命的我，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i no chi no na i wa ta shi ni,</span></p><p begin="2:00.701" end="2:02.553" itunes:key="L82" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:00.701" end="2:00.806">あ</span><span begin="2:00.806" end="2:00.913">な</span><span begin="2:00.913" end="2:01.011">た</span><span begin="2:01.011" end="2:01.124">は</span><span begin="2:01.124" end="2:01.303">どん</span><span begin="2:01.303" end="2:01.532">な</span><span begin="2:01.532" end="2:01.654">イ</span><span begin="2:01.654" end="2:01.843">メー</span><span begin="2:01.843" end="2:01.971">ジ</span><span begin="2:01.971" end="2:02.067">を</span><span begin="2:02.067" end="2:02.154">着</span><span begin="2:02.154" end="2:02.416">せ</span><span begin="2:02.416" end="2:02.553">る？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我的印象如何？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a na ta wa don na i me- ji o ki se ru?</span></p><p begin="2:02.589" end="2:04.198" itunes:key="L83" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:02.589" end="2:03.029">匿</span><span begin="2:03.029" end="2:03.352">名</span><span begin="2:03.447" end="2:03.895">M</span><span begin="2:03.895" end="2:03.999">で</span><span begin="2:03.999" end="2:04.198">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="2:04.272" end="2:05.806" itunes:key="L84" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:04.273" end="2:04.750">特</span><span begin="2:04.750" end="2:04.958">定</span><span begin="2:04.958" end="2:05.160">し</span><span begin="2:05.160" end="2:05.498">ない</span><span begin="2:05.498" end="2:05.608">で</span><span begin="2:05.608" end="2:05.806">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要人肉我哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku te i shi na i de ne.</span></p><p begin="2:06.088" end="2:07.579" itunes:key="L85" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:06.088" end="2:06.452">匿</span><span begin="2:06.452" end="2:06.803">名</span><span begin="2:06.906" end="2:07.325">M</span><span begin="2:07.325" end="2:07.431">で</span><span begin="2:07.431" end="2:07.579">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="2:07.766" end="2:09.294" itunes:key="L86" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:07.766" end="2:07.958">なん</span><span begin="2:07.958" end="2:08.104">か</span><span begin="2:08.104" end="2:08.401">歌っ</span><span begin="2:08.401" end="2:08.524">て</span><span begin="2:08.524" end="2:08.585">る</span><span begin="2:08.585" end="2:09.047">奴</span><span begin="2:09.047" end="2:09.156">で</span><span begin="2:09.156" end="2:09.294">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱歌的那个家伙。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan ka u ta tte ru ya tsu de su.</span></p><p begin="2:09.490" end="2:10.987" itunes:key="L87" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:09.490" end="2:09.683">人</span><span begin="2:09.683" end="2:09.888">間</span><span begin="2:09.888" end="2:10.131">の</span><span begin="2:10.131" end="2:10.322">ふ</span><span begin="2:10.322" end="2:10.513">り</span><span begin="2:10.513" end="2:10.719">し</span><span begin="2:10.719" end="2:10.868">て</span><span begin="2:10.868" end="2:10.987">る、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装作人类的样子，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nin gen no fu ri shi te ru,</span></p><p begin="2:11.153" end="2:12.720" itunes:key="L88" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:11.153" end="2:11.268">た</span><span begin="2:11.268" end="2:11.376">だ</span><span begin="2:11.376" end="2:11.546">の</span><span begin="2:11.546" end="2:11.820">音</span><span begin="2:11.820" end="2:12.011">楽</span><span begin="2:12.011" end="2:12.209">ソ</span><span begin="2:12.209" end="2:12.360">フ</span><span begin="2:12.360" end="2:12.478">ト</span><span begin="2:12.478" end="2:12.581">で</span><span begin="2:12.581" end="2:12.720">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却只是一个音乐软件而已。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta da no on ga ku so fu to de su.</span></p><p begin="2:12.881" end="2:14.393" itunes:key="L89" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:12.881" end="2:13.092">なん</span><span begin="2:13.092" end="2:13.224">に</span><span begin="2:13.224" end="2:13.328">も</span><span begin="2:13.328" end="2:13.449">な</span><span begin="2:13.449" end="2:13.643">かっ</span><span begin="2:13.643" end="2:13.902">た</span><span begin="2:13.902" end="2:14.172">私</span><span begin="2:14.172" end="2:14.393">に、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一无所有的我，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan ni mo na ka tta wa ta shi ni,</span></p><p begin="2:14.393" end="2:16.253" itunes:key="L90" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:14.393" end="2:14.581">沢</span><span begin="2:14.581" end="2:14.805">山</span><span begin="2:14.805" end="2:14.975">の</span><span begin="2:14.975" end="2:15.237">思い</span><span begin="2:15.237" end="2:15.366">出</span><span begin="2:15.366" end="2:15.544">が</span><span begin="2:15.544" end="2:15.673">詰</span><span begin="2:15.673" end="2:15.895">まっ</span><span begin="2:15.895" end="2:16.161">て</span><span begin="2:16.161" end="2:16.253">る。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却积累了许多的回忆。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta ku san no o mo i de ga tsu ma tte ru.</span></p><p begin="2:16.374" end="2:17.864" itunes:key="L91" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:16.374" end="2:16.762">匿</span><span begin="2:16.762" end="2:17.054">名</span><span begin="2:17.164" end="2:17.602">M</span><span begin="2:17.602" end="2:17.724">で</span><span begin="2:17.724" end="2:17.864">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="2:17.875" end="2:19.613" itunes:key="L92" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:17.875" end="2:18.019">す</span><span begin="2:18.019" end="2:18.363">べ</span><span begin="2:18.363" end="2:18.432">て</span><span begin="2:18.432" end="2:18.702">が</span><span begin="2:18.702" end="2:18.862">不</span><span begin="2:18.862" end="2:19.191">思</span><span begin="2:19.191" end="2:19.304">議</span><span begin="2:19.304" end="2:19.456">で</span><span begin="2:19.456" end="2:19.613">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切很不可思议。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su be te ga fu shi gi de su.</span></p><p begin="2:19.757" end="2:21.241" itunes:key="L93" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:19.757" end="2:20.147">匿</span><span begin="2:20.147" end="2:20.420">名</span><span begin="2:20.584" end="2:21.043">M</span><span begin="2:21.043" end="2:21.146">で</span><span begin="2:21.146" end="2:21.241">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de su.</span></p><p begin="2:21.656" end="2:22.575" itunes:key="L94" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.656" end="2:22.037">えー、</span><span begin="2:22.037" end="2:22.166">本</span><span begin="2:22.166" end="2:22.357">日</span><span begin="2:22.357" end="2:22.575">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么，</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">e-, hon ji tsu wa</span></p><p begin="2:22.638" end="2:23.469" itunes:key="L95" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.638" end="2:22.756">貴</span><span begin="2:22.756" end="2:22.924">重</span><span begin="2:22.924" end="2:22.987">な</span><span begin="2:22.987" end="2:23.094">イン</span><span begin="2:23.094" end="2:23.193">タ</span><span begin="2:23.193" end="2:23.469">ビュー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天的访谈真的很有价值</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki cho u na in ta byu-</span></p><p begin="2:23.482" end="2:24.521" itunes:key="L96" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.482" end="2:23.557">あ</span><span begin="2:23.557" end="2:23.653">り</span><span begin="2:23.653" end="2:23.747">が</span><span begin="2:23.747" end="2:23.912">とう</span><span begin="2:23.912" end="2:23.969">ご</span><span begin="2:23.969" end="2:24.069">ざい</span><span begin="2:24.069" end="2:24.161">ま</span><span begin="2:24.161" end="2:24.264">し</span><span begin="2:24.264" end="2:24.521">た。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">非常感谢。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ri ga to u go za i ma shi ta.</span></p><p begin="2:24.924" end="2:26.389" itunes:key="L97" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:24.924" end="2:25.104">なん</span><span begin="2: