an begin="2:31.771" end="2:31.915">あっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是初音… 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha tsu ne... a</span></p><p begin="2:32.178" end="2:33.189" itunes:key="L102" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:32.178" end="2:32.424">匿</span><span begin="2:32.424" end="2:32.570">名</span><span begin="2:32.570" end="2:32.823">M</span><span begin="2:32.823" end="2:32.895">で</span><span begin="2:32.895" end="2:33.043">し</span><span begin="2:33.043" end="2:33.189">た。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是匿名M。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ku me i e mu de shi ta.</span></p></div></body></tt>